laurel 2005: USB CDC-ECM gadget, live console log, command server and panic hold on the Mi A3 (negroni protocol: ue0 192.168.7.2, host 192.168.7.1 MAC 02:00:5e:77:ee:01, log UDP 5140, commands UDP 5141: ping log reboot bootloader recovery poweroff panic; port of sweet 0072-0077 + negroni 0210/0360). Mi A3 addresses: DWC3 0x4e00000, QSCRATCH 0x4ef8800, QUSB2 0x1613000, GCC 0x1400000. On by default with a self-check (GDSC + clocks on, DWC3 GSNPSID, device mode); kill switches laurelusb=0, laurelctl=0, laurelpanicusb=0; laurelpanic=N timed reset.
